[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1916145901","pull_request_review_id":2551880728,"id":1916145901,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc5yNhDt","diff_hunk":"@@ -305,6 +305,40 @@\n \t\t\t\t[/codeblocks]\n \t\t\t</description>\n \t\t</method>\n+\t\t<method name=\"scaled_local\" qualifiers=\"const\">\n+\t\t\t<return type=\"Basis\" />\n+\t\t\t<param index=\"0\" name=\"scale\" type=\"Vector3\" />\n+\t\t\t<description>\n+\t\t\t\tReturns this basis with each axis (column) scaled by the corresponding component in the given [param scale].\n+\t\t\t\tThis operation is a local scale (relative to self).\n+\t\t\t\t[codeblocks]\n+\t\t\t\t[gdscript]\n+\t\t\t\tvar my_basis = Basis(\n+\t\t\t\tVector3(1, 1, 1),\n+\t\t\t\tVector3(2, 2, 2),\n+\t\t\t\tVector3(3, 3, 3)\n+\t\t\t\t)","path":"doc/classes/Basis.xml","commit_id":"b957cf73efd0fc16a391d8e9e4690556acc0b422","original_commit_id":"669ec83c15f49539cb1779d43a0b85e530518725","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"```suggestion\n\t\t\t\t    Vector3(1, 1, 1),\n\t\t\t\t    Vector3(2, 2, 2),\n\t\t\t\t    Vector3(3, 3, 3)\n\t\t\t\t)\n```\nThough it should really be:\n\n```suggestion\n\t\t\t\t        Vector3(1, 1, 1),\n\t\t\t\t        Vector3(2, 2, 2),\n\t\t\t\t        Vector3(3, 3, 3)\n\t\t\t\t    )\n```\nBut the other examples don't follow that style","created_at":"2025-01-15T08:41:26Z","updated_at":"2025-01-15T08:50:42Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101563#discussion_r1916145901","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101563","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1916145901"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101563#discussion_r1916145901"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101563"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1916145901/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":317,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":null,"original_line":320,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":16,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1916147268","pull_request_review_id":2551880728,"id":1916147268,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc5yNhZE","diff_hunk":"@@ -305,6 +305,40 @@\n \t\t\t\t[/codeblocks]\n \t\t\t</description>\n \t\t</method>\n+\t\t<method name=\"scaled_local\" qualifiers=\"const\">\n+\t\t\t<return type=\"Basis\" />\n+\t\t\t<param index=\"0\" name=\"scale\" type=\"Vector3\" />\n+\t\t\t<description>\n+\t\t\t\tReturns this basis with each axis (column) scaled by the corresponding component in the given [param scale].\n+\t\t\t\tThis operation is a local scale (relative to self).\n+\t\t\t\t[codeblocks]\n+\t\t\t\t[gdscript]\n+\t\t\t\tvar my_basis = Basis(\n+\t\t\t\tVector3(1, 1, 1),\n+\t\t\t\tVector3(2, 2, 2),\n+\t\t\t\tVector3(3, 3, 3)\n+\t\t\t\t)\n+\t\t\t\tmy_basis = my_basis.scaled_local(Vector3(0, 2, -2))\n+\n+\t\t\t\tprint(my_basis.x) # Prints (0.0, 0.0, 0.0)\n+\t\t\t\tprint(my_basis.y) # Prints (4.0, 4.0, 4.0)\n+\t\t\t\tprint(my_basis.z) # Prints (-6.0, -6.0, -6.0)\n+\t\t\t\t[/gdscript]\n+\t\t\t\t[csharp]\n+\t\t\t\tvar myBasis = new Basis(\n+\t\t\t\tnew Vector3(1.0f, 1.0f, 1.0f),\n+\t\t\t\tnew Vector3(2.0f, 2.0f, 2.0f),\n+\t\t\t\tnew Vector3(3.0f, 3.0f, 3.0f)","path":"doc/classes/Basis.xml","commit_id":"b957cf73efd0fc16a391d8e9e4690556acc0b422","original_commit_id":"669ec83c15f49539cb1779d43a0b85e530518725","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"```suggestion\n\t\t\t\t    new Vector3(1.0f, 1.0f, 1.0f),\n\t\t\t\t    new Vector3(2.0f, 2.0f, 2.0f),\n\t\t\t\t    new Vector3(3.0f, 3.0f, 3.0f)\n```\n","created_at":"2025-01-15T08:42:02Z","updated_at":"2025-01-15T08:50:42Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101563#discussion_r1916147268","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101563","_links":{"s